## What will be published here

The need, the location, who receives the support, the proposed response, the status and every update. Until CMAX Foundation confirms that content, this page carries no figures or results.

If you already know about this initiative and want to support it, use the form below and mention Venezuela. The Foundation will reply with the confirmed details.
